skill full

layer web
  match app/controllers/**
  match app/views/**
  match app/helpers/**

layer services
  match app/services/**
  match app/jobs/**

layer data
  match app/models/**
  match app/repositories/**

rule web_no_data
  from web
  cannot use data
  severity high
  message Controllers must not talk to models that other layers own as data access.
  hint Call a service. Keep ActiveRecord inside data or an explicit service.
